flowchart TD
    I[INTENÇÃO DO CHEFE] --> M[MEDIR CASA VIVA]
    M --> INV[Inventariar fontes, arquivos, runtime e histórico]
    INV --> CLS{Classificar}
    CLS -->|já existe| REUSE[REUSE / REFINE]
    CLS -->|duplicado| DEDUPE[DEDUPE + preservar ouro]
    CLS -->|histórico| HIST[HISTORICAL → revalidar]
    CLS -->|gap real| GAP[GAP_REAL]
    REUSE --> OWNER[Owner canônico]
    DEDUPE --> OWNER
    HIST --> OWNER
    GAP --> OWNER
    OWNER --> DELTA[Menor delta suficiente]
    DELTA --> WRITER[ONE_WRITER_PER_SCOPE]
    WRITER --> TESTE[Teste + contraprova]
    TESTE --> JUDGE[REALITY = JUDGE]
    JUDGE -->|resíduo| M
    JUDGE -->|sem resíduo material| FP[FIXED_POINT]
